WEBVTT

NOTE Local synthetic narration draft: Microsoft System.Speech, stock en-CA voice. No external model or publication.

scene-01-cue-01
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.715
Evidence Board turns a research

scene-01-cue-02
00:00:01.715 --> 00:00:04.855
question into a decision you can inspect.

scene-01-cue-03
00:00:04.855 --> 00:00:09.215
Instead of a confident answer and a pile
of links, it keeps claims,

scene-01-cue-04
00:00:09.215 --> 00:00:12.800
sources, and unresolved questions
together.

scene-02-cue-01
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.248
This editable sample asks whether a small

scene-02-cue-02
00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:21.614
software team should adopt AI coding
tools.

scene-02-cue-03
00:00:21.614 --> 00:00:25.301
Eight published sources connect to twenty
three research cards.

scene-02-cue-04
00:00:25.301 --> 00:00:29.182
Support, challenges, and context stay
visible.

scene-02-cue-05
00:00:29.182 --> 00:00:30.878
The recommendation is illustrative,

scene-02-cue-06
00:00:30.878 --> 00:00:34.253
not a result measured inside anyone's
company.

scene-03-cue-01
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.715
Open an evidence card to see the
researcher's interpretation beside

scene-03-cue-02
00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:42.285
its recorded source and excerpt.

scene-03-cue-03
00:00:42.285 --> 00:00:45.655
The source link leads to the original
publication.

scene-03-cue-04
00:00:45.655 --> 00:00:50.640
Conflicts remain explicit, and Check
Evidence finds structural gaps.

scene-03-cue-05
00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.370
It does not verify facts.

scene-04-cue-01
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.500
A compatible browser agent can work on

scene-04-cue-02
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.760
this board through ten Web M C P tools.

scene-04-cue-03
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:05.910
Here, native tool calls read accepted
research and retrieve evidence.

scene-04-cue-04
00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.605
This recording demonstrates tool
execution,

scene-04-cue-05
00:01:08.605 --> 00:01:11.305
not an external model session.

scene-05-cue-01
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:18.130
Now a native tool call proposes a cautious
change with a rationale.

scene-05-cue-02
00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:21.165
Accepted research has not changed.

scene-05-cue-03
00:01:21.165 --> 00:01:23.280
The proposal waits in a review panel,

scene-05-cue-04
00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:27.270
where a person can inspect exact
operations, adjust wording,

scene-05-cue-05
00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.395
and select what to keep.

scene-05-cue-06
00:01:29.395 --> 00:01:33.075
No exposed tool can approve its own
proposal.

scene-06-cue-01
00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.405
Review the changes and approve only the
selected operations.

scene-06-cue-02
00:01:42.405 --> 00:01:44.290
The accepted revision advances,

scene-06-cue-03
00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:47.925
while unselected suggestions stay out of
the record.

scene-06-cue-04
00:01:47.925 --> 00:01:49.830
The activity view distinguishes tool

scene-06-cue-05
00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:52.655
execution from the person's approval.

scene-07-cue-01
00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.515
Create a decision brief from the accepted
board.

scene-07-cue-02
00:01:58.515 --> 00:02:01.185
Citations point back to recorded sources,

scene-07-cue-03
00:02:01.185 --> 00:02:04.535
and the Markdown export preserves the
result.

scene-07-cue-04
00:02:04.535 --> 00:02:07.830
Pending suggestions do not enter the
brief.

scene-07-cue-05
00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:10.460
Undo restores the previous accepted
content,

scene-07-cue-06
00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:13.050
keeping the workflow reversible.

scene-08-cue-01
00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.395
This separate judging workspace saves each

scene-08-cue-02
00:02:17.395 --> 00:02:20.525
visitor's editable sample on that device.

scene-08-cue-03
00:02:20.525 --> 00:02:25.060
Personal signed in boards use isolated
account storage instead.

scene-08-cue-04
00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:29.395
No private owner data was copied into the
judging workspace.

scene-09-cue-01
00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.508
Built with Codex, React, and TypeScript.

scene-09-cue-02
00:02:34.508 --> 00:02:36.136
No built in model.

scene-09-cue-03
00:02:36.136 --> 00:02:37.554
Better evidence.

scene-09-cue-04
00:02:37.554 --> 00:02:39.154
Clearer decisions.

